---
import { quotes } from "@/data/llu";
import LluReviewCard from "./LluReviewCard.astro";
---

<section class="llu-section llu-section--flush-top" id="cost">
  <div class="llu-wrap">
    <hr class="llu-rule" />
    <div class="llu-grid llu-grid--split-even llu-mt-72">
      <div>
        <p class="llu-eyebrow">The math</p>
        <h2 class="llu-h2 llu-mt-16">What one more month really costs.</h2>
        <div class="llu-stack llu-measure llu-mt-24">
          <p class="llu-lead">I'm not going to tell you money doesn't matter right now. It matters more than ever.</p>
          <p>
            So put the price next to the real cost. Every month without a paycheque is a month of salary you don't get
            back.
          </p>
          <p>
            One week of a $100,000 salary is $1,923. That's almost three Launch Packs. Earning $75,000? A week is
            $1,442.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="llu-mt-32">
          <LluReviewCard item={quotes.annie} />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="llu-card">
        <p class="llu-title">One month, side by side</p>
        <div class="llu-ledger llu-mt-24">
          <div class="llu-ledger__row">
            <span>One month of a $100,000 salary, before tax</span>
            <span class="llu-ledger__val">$8,333</span>
          </div>
          <div class="llu-ledger__row">
            <span>Average time unemployed in the US</span>
            <span class="llu-ledger__val">5.5 months</span>
          </div>
          <div class="llu-ledger__row">
            <span>5.5 months of that salary</span>
            <span class="llu-ledger__val">$45,833</span>
          </div>
          <div class="llu-ledger__row">
            <span>My Profile Overhaul on its own, as listed on joinclearcareer.com</span>
            <span class="llu-ledger__val">$1,997</span>
          </div>
          <div class="llu-ledger__row llu-ledger__row--total">
            <span class="llu-strong">Launch Pack: your rebuild, plus 3 months in the room</span>
            <span class="llu-ledger__val">$647</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="llu-cap llu-mt-24">
          Arithmetic: $100,000 ÷ 12 = $8,333. $8,333 × 5.5 = $45,833. $100,000 ÷ 52 = $1,923. Average unemployment
          duration is 23.7 weeks, about 5.5 months (U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics, 2025). Launch Pack price is in CAD.
          This is a comparison, not a promise of how fast you'll land.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
